<p class="event-info event-description">LakehLakehouse Day 2026 is an all-day, multi-track conference co-located with Community Over Code Glasgow 2026. Taking place on October 10, the event is dedicated to all things related to open lakehouse technologies under the Apache Software Foundation (ASF) umbrella, with content supporting Apache Iceberg&trade;, Apache Hudi, Apache Parquet&trade;, Apache Gravitino, Apache Polaris&trade;, and more.</p>
